    "updated_at": "2026-07-08T07:40:51Z",
    "body": "I've done a quick survey of some major browsers using the following:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst doc = document.createDocumentFragment();\r\ndoc.append( document.createElement( 'p' ) );\r\ndoc.firstChild.append( document.createProcessingInstruction( 't', 'd' ) );\r\ndoc.firstChild.outerHTML\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Chrome 150: `<p><?t d?></p>`\r\n- Firefox 152: `<p><?t d></p>`\r\n- Safari 26.5: `<p><?t d?></p>`",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
